Want to play a game? Here's a simple one in JavaScript where you can guess a number between 1 and 10:

```javascript
let num = Math.floor(Math.random() * 10) + 1;
let guess;
do {
    guess = parseInt(prompt("Guess a number between 1 and 10:", "-1"));
} while (guess != num);
alert("Great job! You guessed the number!");
```

Just copy this into your browser's console and start guessing!
